ecognition of sorting signals within the cytosolic tails of transmembrane cargo molecules (PubMed:24791904, PubMed:36261523). Involved in TLR3 trafficking (PubMed:24791904)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}